ProtocolFeeCollector::distribute
├── given PAUSE_TYPE is paused
│   └── it should revert with IsPaused
└── given PAUSE_TYPE is not paused
    ├── when the sDUSD vault is not set
    │   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorSdusdNotSet
    ├── when the sDUSD reward period has not finished
    │   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorRewardPeriodNotFinished
    └── when the sDUSD reward period has finished
        ├── it should be callable by any address
        ├── when the collector DUSD balance is zero
        │   ├── it should not transfer DUSD to the treasury
        │   ├── it should not call notifyRewardAmount
        │   └── it should emit Distributed with zero amounts
        ├── when rewardsBps is zero
        │   ├── it should transfer all collected DUSD to the configured treasury
        │   ├── it should not call notifyRewardAmount
        │   └── it should emit Distributed with a zero reward amount
        ├── when rewardsBps equals PERCENTAGE_PRECISION
        │   ├── it should not transfer DUSD to the treasury
        │   ├── it should notify the configured sDUSD vault of all collected DUSD
        │   ├── it should reset the sDUSD allowance to zero
        │   └── it should emit Distributed with a zero treasury amount
        ├── when rewardsBps is between zero and PERCENTAGE_PRECISION
        │   ├── it should calculate rewardAmount by rounding down
        │   ├── it should calculate treasuryAmount as collected minus rewardAmount
        │   ├── it should transfer treasuryAmount to the configured treasury
        │   ├── it should approve only rewardAmount to the configured sDUSD vault
        │   ├── it should call notifyRewardAmount with rewardAmount
        │   ├── it should reset the sDUSD allowance to zero
        │   ├── it should leave the collector with zero distributed DUSD
        │   └── it should emit Distributed with the collected, treasury, and reward amounts
        └── when block timestamp equals rewardPeriodFinish
            └── it should allow distribution
